{"id":"5E","title":"Fornication and Sexual Immorality","part":{"n":5,"title":"Marriage and Divorce"},"url":"/law/05-marriage-and-divorce/5e","entries":[{"id":"5E.1","text":"It is the will of God that you abstain from fornication and sexual immorality.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":15,"verses":"20,29"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":6,"verses":"9,13,18"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"3-5"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":4,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Acts 15:20, 29; 1 Cor. 6:9, 13, 18; 1 Cor 10:8; Eph. 5:3-5; Col. 3:5; 1 Thes. 4:3."},{"id":"5E.2","text":"A woman married who is believed to be a virgin and found out not to be, shall be stoned to death for playing the whore in her father's house.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":22,"verses":"14-21"}],"citation":"Deut. 22:14-21."},{"id":"5E.3","text":"If a man entices a woman not engaged, and lies with her, he must endow her to be his wife.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":22,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Exod. 22:16."},{"id":"5E.4","text":"To avoid fornication, let every man have his own wife, and every woman her own husband.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":7,"verses":"2,9"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 7:2, 9."},{"id":"5E.5","text":"There shall be no whore of the daughters of Israel.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":23,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Deut. 23:17."},{"id":"5E.6","text":"law does not sanction fornication. 1 Tim. 1:9-10. God will judge the sexually immoral acts of persons.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":21,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":22,"verses":"15-16"}],"citation":"Heb. 13:4; Rev. 21:8; Rev. 22:15-16."},{"id":"5E.7","text":"Fornication is ruinous.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":23,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":31,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Hosea","chapter":4,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:26; Prov. 23:27; Prov. 29:3; Prov. 31:3; Hos. 4:11."},{"id":"5E.9","text":"You shall not approach a woman unclean by menstruation to uncover her sexuality and lie with her.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":18,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Lev. 18:19; Lev. 20:18."},{"id":"5E.10","text":"We are not to associate with fornicators.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 5:9."},{"id":"5E.11","text":"Repent of any fornication committed.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 12:21."}]}